          "topic": "Video evidence in agent-assisted code review",
          "text": "Agent recorded video recording of end-to-end walkthrough.\n\n(In this case: clicking on commented-on text jumps back to source location).\n\nNow, how differently do you approach a code review if you know there's video proof that it works?",
